    "ambiguityNote":  "acceptableAlternatives lists categories a careful human could also defend. Accuracy is strict - only \u0027expected\u0027 counts - but a miss landing in the alternatives is classified \u0027ambiguous\u0027 rather than \u0027clearly wrong\u0027 in the error taxonomy. Declared before any run so the classification cannot be fitted to results."
